flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Take out the power, secure the main display room, and steal the rare painting from the museum."])
 _A1_(["The team parks up near the museum&#39;s main entrance."])
 _A1_1_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 enter on foot as the others drive around to the north side."])
 _A1_2_(["The pair make their way through the Museum, blending with the regular patrons."])
 _A1_2_Cont_(["Reaching the main display room, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 scope out the security situation."])
 _A1_3_(["With the duo ready to strike, Muscle #1 heads to the window to signal the others."])
 _A1_4_(["The crew emerges from the vehicle, Engineer heading straight for the electrical junction."])
 _A1_C1_{"Engineer opens the cabinet and attempts to cut the museum&#39;s feed."}
 _A1_C1P_["With a snip from the wire cutters, Engineer cuts the primary supply cable."]
 _A2_(["The museum is temporarily plunged into darkness, causing panic among the patrons."])
 _A2_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 try to take the guards down using the blackout as cover."}
 _A2_C1P_["The painting&#39;s guards are dropped in the dark with a flurry of punches."]
 _A3_(["As the emergency lights flicker on, a third guard sees what&#39;s happened and runs for help."])
 _A3_1_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 clear the room and block the entrance while the others set up outside."])
 _A3_2_(["Outside, Looter #1 pulls the ladder from the van and sets it against the building."])
 _A3_3_(["Looter #2 grabs the circular saw and ascends carefully."])
 _A3_C1_{"Looter #1 steadies the ladder while Looter #2 tries to cut through the window."}
 _A3_C1P_["Looter #2 makes two vertical cuts through the window&#39;s metal frame."]
 _A4_(["The window frame is tilted inward, easing the intact pane out of its mounts."])
 _A4_1_(["Looter #2 climbs through the window, with the others following behind."])
 _A4_C1_{"Engineer inspects the main display case and guides Looter #2 on where to cut."}
 _A4_C1P_["Looter #2 holds the angle grinder steady as it eats through the metal plinth."]
 _A5_(["Knowing the case will take time to breach, Muscle #1 and Looter #1 search the next room."])
 _A5_1_(["Within the Icons exhibition, Looter #1 locates a table case of valuable ancient sculptures."])
 _A5_C1_{"Looter #1 looks for a way to open the case carefully."}
 _A5_C1P_["Looter #1 drives a shoulder under one edge and pops the hinge alignment out of place."]
 _A6_R1_(["Looter #1 retrieves two Shabti Sculptures from the display case."])
 _A6_(["Muscle #1 helps Looter #1 haul the loot to the window while Looter #2 continues to work."])
 _A6_1_(["Muscle #2 spots a team of guards coming and pulls out the floor cleaner."])
 _A6_C1_{"Muscle #1 goads the guards while Muscle #2 covers the floor with the liquid."}
 _A6_C1P_["Failing to notice the slippery surface, the guards slip as they round the corner."]
 _A7_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 batter the guards as they squirm around on the floor."])
 _A7_1_(["Looter #2 whoops with delight as the main display finally cracks."])
 _A7_R1_(["The heavy glass pane tumbles aside, allowing Looter #2 to pull out the valuable painting."])
 _A7_2_(["The painting is carefully lowered down the ladder as the crew exits the museum."])
 _A7_3_(["As the police sirens draw near, Muscle #1 grabs the razor wire from the back of the van."])
 _A7_C1_{"Engineer and Muscle #1 rush to unfurl the razor wire across the road."}
 _A7_C1P_["Muscle #1 holds the wire steady as Engineer drags it into position."]
 _A8_(["The wire is secured between two streetlights before the pair return to the vehicle."])
 _A8_1_(["Unable to stop in time, two motorcycle cops are sliced in half as they speed toward the team."])
 _A8_2_(["The wire shreds the tires of the incoming cop cars, leaving the crew free to escape."])
 _A8S_(["The team races off with the museum&#39;s treasures, their path to freedom clear."])
 _A3_C1F_["The angle grinder jams in the frame, forcing Looter #2 to wrench it free."]
 _A3_C2_{"Looter #2 goes for another cut while Looter #1 continues holding the ladder."}
 _A3_C2P_["This time, the angle grinder churns through the window&#39;s metal frame with ease."]
 _A6_R3_(["Looter #1 loads eight Buddha Sculptures into his holdall."])
 _A7_C1F_["Engineer is almost clipped by a car as the razor wire is snagged by a passing truck."]
 _A7_C2_{"Two motorcycle cops pull up, so Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 step out to meet them."}
 _A7_C2F_["Muscle #2 takes a bullet as Muscle #1 rushes back to the van."]
 _A7_4_(["Sensing the team needs a diversion, Looter #2 emerges brandishing the angle grinder."])
 _A7_C3_{"Looter #2 tries to distract the cops while Muscle #1 sneaks around to attack them."}
 _A7_C3P_["Muscle #1 ambushes the cops while they are distracted by Looter #2&#39;s lunatic behavior."]
 _A8_4_(["The second officer makes it to the van and swipes the valuable statues."])
 _A8_5_(["Looter #2 and Muscle #1 are put down with Taser strikes, so the others decide to flee."])
 _A8S3_(["Engineer and Looter #1 make off with the painting, leaving their teammates behind."])
 _A6_C1F_["Muscle #2 takes too long prepping the floor and the guards notice the trap."]
 _A6_2_(["The security team inches past the slippery patch and confronts the crew with violent force."])
 _C6_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 brace themselves for a brutal brawl with the guards."}
 _C6_C1F_["The force of numbers proves too much for the pair, and they are beaten down to the floor."]
 _C6_C2_{"Looter #2 points the angle grinder toward the guards to threaten them into backing off."}
 _C6_C2P_["Looter #2&#39;s aggressive stance lets Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 counterattack the guards."]
 _C6_1_(["As the case is breached, the others smuggle the painting out of the window."])
 _C6_2_(["Looter #2 tosses the statues down in a hurry, shattering the whole collection."])
 _C6_3_(["As Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are finally overcome, the others rush to the escape vehicle."])
 _C6S_(["Having secured the valuable painting, the team shoots off with two teammates in custody."])
 _A1_C1F_["Despite Engineer&#39;s interference, the museum&#39;s power remains stable."]
 _A1_C2_{"Engineer digs past the wiring to try and remove the large cartridge fuses."}
 _A1_C2P_["Several cartridge fuses are disconnected from their holders and tossed aside."]
 _A4_C1F_["Looter #2 pushes the angle grinder too hard and snaps the blade in two."]
 _A4_C2_{"Pulling a backup blade from the carry case, Looter #2 and Engineer try again."}
 _A4_C2P_["On the second attempt, Looter #2 starts to bite smoothly through the metal plinth."]
 _A6_R2_(["Looter #1 pulls three Ganesha Sculptures from the display case."])
 _A5_C1F_["Looter #1 tries to pry the case lid open, but it won&#39;t budge."]
 _A5_C2_{"Looter #1 asks Muscle #1 to help her smash the case open"}
 _A5_C2P_["Using a metal rope stanchion, Muscle #1 destroys the case door."]
 _A4_C2F_["The toughened glass resists Looter #2&#39;s attempt to cut through it."]
 _A4_2_(["Recognizing the futility of the situation, Engineer declares the case unbreachable."])
 _A4_3_(["The looters give up on the main prize and head to the Religious Texts exhibition."])
 _B5_C1_{"Looter #1 grabs the angle grinder and tries to break open a display case."}
 _B5_C1P_["The grinder makes short work of the frame, allowing Looter #1 to remove the glass."]
 _B5_R2_(["A pair of Companion Scripts by Ubay are retrieved."])
 _B6_(["Looter #2 sees some exciting weaponry in the History of Warfare room and dashes in."])
 _B6_1_(["Scrutinizing the loot, Looter #2 notices the best stuff is kept behind a glass screen."])
 _B6_2_(["Engineer is called over to help look for a way inside."])
 _B6_C1_{"Engineer and Looter #2 try to break into the wall display."}
 _B6_C1F_["After removing a panel, Engineer finds the lock is too complicated to bypass quickly."]
 _B6_3_(["Next to the wall display is a cabinet containing some ancient armor."])
 _B6_C2_{"Looter #1 and Looter #2 try to open the cabinet without damaging the contents."}
 _B6_C2P_["With Looter #1 bracing the cabinet, Looter #2 is able to wrench one of the doors open."]
 _B6_R2_(["Four medieval helmets are extracted in pristine condition."])
 _B6_7_(["With more prizes secured, Looter #1 and Looter #2 take their loot back toward the window."])
 _B7_2_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 follow, keeping watch for any trouble."])
 _B7_3_(["As the loot is passed down to Engineer, a large team of security guards surprises the crew."])
 _B7_C3_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 try to delay the guards by pulling over a heavy display case."}
 _B7_C3P_["The case is pulled over by the doorway, slowing the guards&#39; progress."]
 _B8_3_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 rush to the window while the guards kick through the obstruction."])
 _B8_3_Cont_(["Reaching the street, they grab the razor wire to try and block the road."])
 _B8_4_(["The others are told to leave as Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 set a trap for the cops."])
 _B8_5_(["Seeing the razor wire, the cops screech to a halt by the museum."])
 _B8S2_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are arrested as their teammates make off with the loot."])
 _C6_C1P_["Despite overwhelming odds, the duo fend off the security team."]
 _A2_C1F_["The guards prove surprisingly agile and fend off the crew&#39;s attack."]
 _A2_C2_{"In the dim light, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 try to double-team the guards one by one."}
 _A2_C2P_["The first guard&#39;s head is smashed against the display case, the second choked out in a headlock."]
 _C6_C2F_["A guard sidesteps Looter #2 and snatches the grinder from his grasp to defuse the threat."]
 _C6F_(["As the mission collapses, the guards secure the room and capture the whole team."])
 _B5_C1F_["The blade snaps, causing Looter #1 to scream out in frustration."]
 _B5_C2_{"Dropping the tool, Looter #1 tries to find a simpler way into the secure glass case."}
 _B5_C2P_["Looter #1 finds a maintenance panel beneath the case and pries it open with his fingers."]
 _B6_C1P_["Engineer removes a panel and unlocks the mechanism, letting the glass retract downward."]
 _B6_R1_(["Looter #2 climbs in and pulls out a fine Naval Cutlass."])
 _B7_(["Looter #1 helps Looter #2 to pile their haul by the window."])
 _B7_1_(["Four security guards storm the room, forcing Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 into action."])
 _B7_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 try to hold the guards off for as long as possible."}
 _B7_C1P_["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 dominate the guards, beating them all unconscious."]
 _B8_(["Muscle #2 grabs a guard&#39;s radio and screams that the thieves are heading to the plushie wing."])
 _B8_1_(["With the authorities diverted, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 climb down to escape."])
 _B8_2_(["The spool of razor wire is quickly deployed across the road to hinder their pursuers."])
 _B8S_(["The team drives off hurriedly as several vehicles pile up behind them."])
 _A5_C2F_["Muscle #1 shoves the case over, shattering it completely and destroying the contents."]
 _A5_2_(["The noise startles Looter #2, who inadvertently cuts straight through the precious painting."])
 _A5_3_(["Frustrated, the team decides to loot another room, moving to the Religious Texts exhibition."])
 _B5_R1_(["Two copies of the Companion Script by Ali are taken."])
 _A7_C3F_["The pair are quickly subdued, and more cops arrive to box in the escape vehicle."]
 _A7F_(["The remaining teammates give themselves up, their dreams of riches now mere history."])
 _A1_C2F_["The cartridges refuse to budge, each one fixed in place with a security bracket."]
 _A1_C3_{"Engineer ditches subtlety and starts ripping out wires left, right, and center."}
 _A1_C3P_["The load indicator on the service panel drops to nothing as the electricity supply goes dead."]
 _A7_C2P_["The police officers are beaten, but some of the sculptures are damaged in the melee."]
 _A8_3_(["Looter #1 loads the surviving statues into the van with the painting and climbs aboard."])
 _A8S2_(["By the time the squad cars show up, the crew has already made its escape."])
 _B7_C1F_["The pair take a severe beating and are pushed back toward the others."]
 _B7_C2_{"Brandishing their stolen cutlasses, Looter #1 and Looter #2 join the fray."}
 _B7_C2P_["The combined effort of all four teammates helps to keep the security guards at bay."]
 _A2_C2F_["Their plan fails, with neither guard subdued by the time the emergency lights flicker on."]
 _A2_1_(["Seeing the fight underway, the third guard runs over to aid her colleagues."])
 _A2F_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are subdued and arrested, the museum heist botched from the start."])
 _A1_C3F_["Engineer inadvertently touches a live wire and is flung back toward the road."]
 _A1_5_(["As Engineer spasms uncontrollably, his teammates drag him to safety"])
 _A1F_(["Unable to cut the museum&#39;s power, the crew calls it quits and quietly disperses from the area."])
 _B7_C2F_["The guards continue to encroach on the team, backing them into the main display room."]
 _B7_4_(["Muscle #1 tells Looter #1 and Looter #2 to go while he will stay and fight."])
 _B7_C3F_["The case proves too heavy for the pair to move and they are quickly overpowered."]
 _B7F_(["The whole crew is detained at the scene, their museum theft thwarted."])
 _B5_R3_(["Looter #1 pulls out two Companion Scripts by Abdullah from the display case."])
 _A3_C2F_["The grinder kicks back, throwing Looter #2 from the ladder."]
 _A3_4_(["Looter #1 is sliced open by the grinder while trying to soften Looter #2&#39;s fall."])
 _A3_5_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 witness the grisly scene from above and realize the mission is over."])
 _A3F_(["Engineer bundles his injured teammates into the van, their dreams of riches cut down."])
 _B5_C2F_["Looter #1&#39;s attempts to shunt the case lid off its hinges fail miserably."]
 _B5_C3_{"Looter #1 fits another blade to the angle grinder and tries to cut it again."}
 _B5_C3P_["Looter #1 splits the frame in two, allowing him to remove the front panel."]
 _B6_C2F_["Try as they might, the cabinet&#39;s doors will not budge, their fixings made of strong metal."]
 _B6_4_(["The pair move on, spotting a table case displaying some brutal medieval weaponry."])
 _B6_C3_{"Looter #1 and Looter #2 work together to break the case open."}
 _B6_C3P_["Using brute force, the case lid is wrenched aside, allowing them to access the contents."]
 _B6_R3_(["Five fearsome-looking flails are pilfered."])
 _B6_8_(["Looter #1 and Looter #2 start taking the loot through to the main display room."])
 _B5_C3F_["The blade hits the glass and splits, a chunk flying off and striking Looter #1 in the face."]
 _B5_1_(["Looter #2 rushes over to help his stricken colleague as the others stand watch."])
 _B5F_(["The crew admits defeat and dashes for the window, thwarted by panes of toughened glass."])
 _B6_C3F_["The case lid proves too tough to crack, leaving the duo empty-handed once more."]
 _B6_5_(["Muscle #1 walks over to help, branding the pair pathetic and weak."])
 _B6_6_(["Left alone, Muscle #2 is hit with an ambush by the museum&#39;s security team."])
